/**

This is the main class for the Balls project. It initializes the BallsManager and starts the simulation.

The idea of this project is to create a simple animation of bouncing balls on the screen. 
The BallsManager class is responsible for managing the balls, including their creation, movement, and rendering. 
The Main class serves as the entry point for the program, where it initializes the BallsManager and starts the animation loop.

User can add new balls by pressing the Up key, and the count of balls is displayed on the screen.
User can remove the most recently added ball by pressing the Down key. 

*/

class Main {
    function void main() {
        var BallsManager ballsManager;
        let ballsManager = BallsManager.new();
        do ballsManager.run();
        do ballsManager.dispose();
        return;
    }
}
